    s_SOMEONE_NORMAL_ANY(py_str("Some of it is age and some is not, and the difference is what changed and how fast: a slower, steadier version of the same person is the ordinary kind, and a change over days or weeks, or a stop in something they always did, is worth a GP appointment. A note of what you have seen and when is what makes that appointment useful."));
